## Interface: 16001
## Title: AbsoluteUI
## Notes: Clean, modern restyle of Blizzard's UI: player, target, focus and pet frames with 3D portraits, auras, castbars, swing timers, action bars, experience and reputation bars, tooltips, menus, loot, bags, spellbook, talents, quest windows, world map and quest log, quest tracker and damage meter.
